Z||000006||robertjay||11-12-2000||02:03 AM||||My 85 GT has the 85 MPH speedo, but on a trip back from British Columbia, I found a long straight stretch to get the speedo rapped all the way around to 10 MPH again.  I'd guess it at 125 or so.  Just for grins, I raised my headlights, then put them back down.  The headlights went down, but the doors stayed up.  It was fun.||||reg||1
